# The app's real paths (2026-10-26, AXIS Launch taskgate T151). Each route the router knows by a pathname alias
# (src/routes.tsx) that is not prerendered, and each path the API sends people to, is served the app shell (/spa-shell: a rewrite to
# /index.html is answered with a 308 to /). There is
# no catch-all: an unknown path answers 404 with 404.html, not the home page with 200 (crawlers had /llms.txt,
# /openapi.json and the .well-known files queued as pages). Held equal to the router by src/redirects.test.ts.
/account /spa-shell 200
/account/ /spa-shell 200
